#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/content-change-review.bpmn:165
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "content-change-review-committee.bpmn: compare staged against main, slice the change and review each slice, settle withdrawals and disputes, gate on coverage, review the impact, and either approve or request changes. The one judgement inside it is Call_Adjudication, whose `stands` / `withdrawn` this call accepts; public-comment, which calls this whole process, reaches it through here."
